@title Panel homes: the page commands are in the Pages list, the lesson buttons on the lesson card
@area Layout
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Lane V4e (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 5.2). File > Pages (6 rows) and Help > Lesson (4 rows)
# are gone: the Pages list has the + New button and the right-click menu of a page, the lesson card has
# its Back, Next, Start over and Close. Every command still runs from Ctrl+K, which names the panel.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text File #1
wait 6
shot file-menu
expect_not "New page"
expect_not "Duplicate page"
expect_not "Move page up"
key Escape
wait 4
click_text Help #1
wait 6
shot help-menu
expect_not "Lesson: next step"
expect_not "Lesson: start over"
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text "duplicate page"
wait 8
shot palette-panel-chip
expect "Pages list"
key Escape
